"Done, Don't Relaunch" = "完成，不重新启动";
"Quit & Relaunch" = "退出并重新启动";
"Open System Settings…" = "打开系统设置…";
"Welcome to FileFluss" = "欢迎使用 FileFluss";
"A few seconds of setup will make FileFluss feel instant." = "只需几秒钟设置，就能让 FileFluss 用起来快如闪电。";
"Grant Full Disk Access (recommended)" = "授予完全磁盘访问权限（推荐）";
"FileFluss can browse every folder instantly, with no per-folder permission prompts." = "FileFluss 可以即时浏览每个文件夹，无需逐个文件夹授权。";
"Or continue without it" = "或不授予并继续";
"macOS will ask once per protected folder (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, …). The first open of each may take a few seconds — but only the first time." = "macOS 会对每个受保护的文件夹（桌面、文稿、下载……）询问一次。每个文件夹首次打开可能需要几秒钟——但仅限首次。";
"Add FileFluss to Full Disk Access" = "将 FileFluss 添加到完全磁盘访问";
"System Settings is now open. Drag the FileFluss icon below into the **Full Disk Access** list — then click **Quit & Relaunch** so the new permission takes effect." = "系统设置已打开。将下方的 FileFluss 图标拖入**完全磁盘访问**列表，然后点按**退出并重新启动**以使新权限生效。";
"Or click the **+** button in System Settings and pick FileFluss from your Applications folder." = "或在系统设置中点按 **+** 按钮，并从“应用程序”文件夹中选择 FileFluss。";
"Drag into the Full Disk Access list" = "拖入完全磁盘访问列表";
