/* Help (FileFluss Help window) */
"Overview" = "概览";
"Two‑Panel Layout" = "双面板布局";
"Adding Cloud Accounts" = "添加云账户";
"Copying and Moving Files" = "复制和移动文件";
"Copy Mode and Move Mode" = "复制模式和移动模式";
"Sync" = "同步";
"Compare Folders" = "比较文件夹";
"Search" = "搜索";
"Opening Files" = "打开文件";
"FileFluss is a dual‑panel file manager for macOS that lets you work with local folders and multiple cloud storage accounts side by side. It is built around a left and right panel — copy, move, sync, and compare files between them with a few clicks." = "FileFluss 是一款适用于 macOS 的双面板文件管理器，可让你并排处理本地文件夹和多个云存储账户。它围绕左右两个面板构建——只需点按几下，即可在二者之间复制、移动、同步和比较文件。";
"At a glance" = "概要";
"**Two independent panels**, each can show a local folder or a connected cloud account." = "**两个独立的面板**，每个都可显示本地文件夹或已连接的云账户。";
"**Drag & drop** between panels to copy or move files." = "在面板之间**拖放**以复制或移动文件。";
"**Sync** to make the two sides match (mirror, newer, or additive)." = "**同步**以使两侧保持一致（镜像、较新或追加）。";
"**Compare** to see which files differ, are missing, or match between the two sides." = "**比较**以查看两侧之间哪些文件有差异、缺失或一致。";
"**Search** across local files and every connected cloud account at once." = "同时在本地文件和每个已连接的云账户中**搜索**。";
"Toolbar" = "工具栏";
"**Search** (⌘F) — open the search window." = "**搜索**（⌘F）——打开搜索窗口。";
"**Sync** — open the Sync planner." = "**同步**——打开同步规划器。";
"**Compare** — open the Compare Folders window." = "**比较**——打开“比较文件夹”窗口。";
"**Refresh** — reload both panels." = "**刷新**——重新加载两个面板。";
"**Hidden Files** — toggle showing dotfiles in the active panel." = "**隐藏文件**——在活动面板中切换显示点文件。";
"**Copy Mode** / **Move Mode** — force every drag & drop to that operation." = "**复制模式** / **移动模式**——强制每次拖放都执行该操作。";
"Right‑click the toolbar and choose *Customize Toolbar…* to rearrange or hide buttons." = "右键点按工具栏并选择 *自定工具栏…* 以重新排列或隐藏按钮。";
"FileFluss shows a left panel and a right panel. The active panel is marked with a thin accent line at the top — most actions (toolbar buttons, keyboard shortcuts, the search target) apply to whichever panel is active." = "FileFluss 显示一个左面板和一个右面板。活动面板顶部带有一条细的强调线标记——大多数操作（工具栏按钮、键盘快捷键、搜索目标）都作用于当前活动的面板。";
"Switching panels" = "切换面板";
"Click anywhere inside a panel to make it active." = "点按面板内任意位置即可将其激活。";
"The sidebar of each panel is independent — choose a different favourite, location, or cloud account on each side." = "每个面板的边栏都是独立的——可在每一侧选择不同的收藏、位置或云账户。";
"The path bar" = "路径栏";
"The breadcrumb at the top of each panel shows the current folder path. Click any segment to navigate up." = "每个面板顶部的路径面包屑显示当前文件夹路径。点按任一段即可向上导航。";
"You can drop files onto a path‑bar segment to move/copy them into that folder." = "你也可以将文件拖放到路径栏的某一段，以将其移动/复制到该文件夹中。";
"Cloud accounts on both sides" = "两侧的云账户";
"If you open the same cloud account in both panels (e.g. kDrive on the left and on the right), the two panels behave **independently**: you can browse to different folders on each side and drag between them." = "如果你在两个面板中打开同一个云账户（例如左右都是 kDrive），这两个面板将**独立**运作：你可以在每一侧浏览到不同的文件夹并在它们之间拖动。";
"Dragging a file from the same cloud account on the left to a folder on the right does an **in‑cloud** move/copy — the data stays on the server, no re‑upload." = "将左侧同一云账户中的文件拖到右侧的某个文件夹，会执行**云端内**移动/复制——数据保留在服务器上，无需重新上传。";
"Cloud accounts are connected once and then appear in the sidebar of both panels." = "云账户只需连接一次，随后会出现在两个面板的边栏中。";
"Add an account" = "添加账户";
"Open **Settings → Cloud Accounts** (⌘,)." = "打开 **设置 → 云账户**（⌘,）。";
"Click **Add Cloud Account** and pick the provider (kDrive, pCloud, OneDrive, Google Drive, Dropbox, MEGA, Koofr, NextCloud, WebDAV, SFTP, GMX Cloud, WordPress, …)." = "点按 **添加云账户** 并选择服务商（kDrive、pCloud、OneDrive、Google Drive、Dropbox、MEGA、Koofr、NextCloud、WebDAV、SFTP、GMX Cloud、WordPress……）。";
"Sign in via the provider's authentication flow. FileFluss stores the tokens securely in your macOS Keychain." = "通过服务商的认证流程登录。FileFluss 会将令牌安全地存储在你的 macOS 钥匙串中。";
"The new account immediately appears in both panels' sidebars." = "新账户会立即出现在两个面板的边栏中。";
"Use an account" = "使用账户";
"Click the account in either sidebar to load it in that panel." = "在任一边栏中点按该账户，即可在该面板中加载它。";
"Navigate folders the same way as local — double‑click to enter, or click breadcrumbs to go back up." = "像浏览本地一样浏览文件夹——双击进入，或点按面包屑返回上层。";
"Remove an account" = "移除账户";
"In **Settings → Cloud Accounts**, click the trash icon next to the account." = "在 **设置 → 云账户** 中，点按账户旁边的垃圾桶图标。";
"FileFluss disconnects the account, removes the cached login, and clears its panels." = "FileFluss 会断开该账户、移除缓存的登录信息并清空其面板。";
"Some providers expose a sandboxed root (e.g. WordPress' media library). Behaviour like *create folder* may be unavailable for those providers — FileFluss greys out the actions that don't apply." = "某些服务商提供沙盒化的根目录（例如 WordPress 的媒体库）。对这些服务商，*新建文件夹* 等行为可能不可用——FileFluss 会将不适用的操作变灰。";
"There are several ways to move or copy files between the two panels:" = "在两个面板之间移动或复制文件有多种方式：";
"Drag & drop" = "拖放";
"Drag selected files from one panel and drop them on the other." = "从一个面板拖动所选文件并放到另一个面板上。";
"By default a prompt appears asking *Move or Copy?*." = "默认情况下会出现一个询问 *移动还是复制？* 的提示。";
"Drop directly onto a folder row to land inside that folder, or onto the table background to drop into the panel's current directory." = "直接放到某个文件夹行上即可放入该文件夹，或放到表格背景上即可放入面板的当前目录。";
"You can also drop onto a breadcrumb in the path bar to land in that ancestor folder." = "你也可以放到路径栏的某个面包屑上，以放入该上级文件夹。";
"Right‑click" = "右键点按";
"Select files, right‑click, and choose **Copy to Other Panel** or **Move to Other Panel**." = "选择文件，右键点按，然后选择 **复制到另一面板** 或 **移动到另一面板**。";
"Same effect as drag & drop, but no prompt — the action is taken immediately." = "效果与拖放相同，但没有提示——操作会立即执行。";
"Conflicts" = "冲突";
"If a file with the same name already exists at the destination, FileFluss asks how to resolve the conflict (replace, keep both, skip)." = "如果目标位置已存在同名文件，FileFluss 会询问如何解决冲突（替换、两者都保留、跳过）。";
"If you find the *Move or Copy?* prompt repetitive, enable **Copy Mode** or **Move Mode** in the toolbar — see the next section." = "如果你觉得 *移动还是复制？* 提示太频繁，可在工具栏中启用 **复制模式** 或 **移动模式**——见下一节。";
"**Copy Mode** and **Move Mode** are two toolbar toggles that change how every drag & drop is interpreted." = "**复制模式** 和 **移动模式** 是工具栏中的两个开关，用于改变每次拖放的解释方式。";
"Copy Mode" = "复制模式";
"When active, every drop is automatically a **copy** — the *Move or Copy?* prompt is skipped." = "启用后，每次放下都会自动执行**复制**——会跳过 *移动还是复制？* 提示。";
"Useful when you're duplicating a lot of files between folders or panels." = "在文件夹或面板之间复制大量文件时很有用。";
"Move Mode" = "移动模式";
"When active, every drop is automatically a **move** — files are removed from the source." = "启用后，每次放下都会自动执行**移动**——文件会从来源中移除。";
"Useful when re‑organising a folder." = "重新整理文件夹时很有用。";
"Important" = "重要";
"The two toggles are **mutually exclusive** — turning one on turns the other off." = "这两个开关**互斥**——开启其中一个会关闭另一个。";
"Both reset to off when FileFluss relaunches, so a stuck *Move Mode* can't silently destroy files across sessions." = "二者都会在 FileFluss 重新启动时重置为关闭，因此卡住的 *移动模式* 不会在多次会话中悄悄破坏文件。";
"When neither mode is on, FileFluss falls back to the standard *Move or Copy?* prompt." = "当两种模式都未开启时，FileFluss 会回退到标准的 *移动还是复制？* 提示。";
"**Sync** makes the destination folder match the source folder according to the rule you choose. Use it for one‑shot replications between local and cloud, or between two cloud accounts." = "**同步** 会根据你选择的规则使目标文件夹与来源文件夹一致。可用于本地与云、或两个云账户之间的一次性复制。";
"Run a sync" = "运行同步";
"Open one folder on the left and one on the right." = "在左侧打开一个文件夹，在右侧打开一个文件夹。";
"Click **Sync** in the toolbar." = "点按工具栏中的 **同步**。";
"Choose the **direction** (Left → Right or Right → Left)." = "选择**方向**（左 → 右 或 右 → 左）。";
"Choose the **mode** (see below)." = "选择**模式**（见下文）。";
"FileFluss enumerates both sides and shows a plan: how many files will be added, replaced, deleted, and how many bytes will be transferred. Click **Start Sync**." = "FileFluss 会枚举两侧并显示一个计划：将添加、替换、删除多少文件，以及将传输多少字节。点按 **开始同步**。";
"Modes" = "模式";
"**Newer** — copy files from the source whose modification date is newer than the destination's. Existing files only get replaced if they're truly newer." = "**较新**——从来源复制修改日期比目标更新的文件。仅当文件确实更新时才会替换现有文件。";
"**Mirror** — make the destination an exact copy of the source. **Files at the destination that are not on the source are deleted.** This is destructive — FileFluss requires explicit confirmation." = "**镜像**——使目标成为来源的精确副本。**目标中不存在于来源的文件将被删除。** 此操作具有破坏性——FileFluss 需要明确确认。";
"**Additive** — only copy files that are missing on the destination. If a file already exists, the source is added next to it with a unique name. Nothing is overwritten or deleted." = "**追加**——仅复制目标中缺失的文件。如果文件已存在，会以唯一名称将来源添加到其旁边。不会覆盖或删除任何内容。";
"During sync, if a file with the same name exists on both sides but neither mode handles it cleanly, FileFluss asks per‑file how to resolve." = "在同步过程中，如果两侧都存在同名文件，但没有任何模式能干净地处理它，FileFluss 会逐个文件询问如何解决。";
"Sync runs in the background — you can keep working in either panel while it transfers. Progress shows in the destination panel's sidebar; click it to see details." = "同步在后台运行——传输期间你可以继续在任一面板中工作。进度显示在目标面板的边栏中；点按即可查看详情。";
"**Compare** shows you the differences between the two panels' folders without changing anything." = "**比较** 会在不更改任何内容的情况下向你显示两个面板文件夹之间的差异。";
"Run a comparison" = "运行比较";
"Click **Compare** in the toolbar." = "点按工具栏中的 **比较**。";
"FileFluss enumerates both sides recursively and opens a window with the result." = "FileFluss 会递归枚举两侧，并打开一个显示结果的窗口。";
"Reading the result" = "读取结果";
"**Different** (red ⚠) — file exists on both sides but its size (or modification date, if enabled) differs." = "**不同**（红色 ⚠）——文件在两侧都存在，但其大小（或修改日期，若启用）不同。";
"**Only on Left** (← blue) — file exists only in the left folder." = "**仅左侧**（← 蓝色）——文件仅存在于左侧文件夹中。";
"**Only on Right** (→ orange) — file exists only in the right folder." = "**仅右侧**（→ 橙色）——文件仅存在于右侧文件夹中。";
"**Identical** (✓ green) — file matches on both sides." = "**相同**（✓ 绿色）——文件在两侧一致。";
