"Endpoint URL (e.g. https://eu-005.s3.synologyc2.net)" = "端点 URL（例如 https://eu-005.s3.synologyc2.net）";
"Endpoint URL (e.g. https://fsn1.your-objectstorage.com)" = "端点 URL（例如 https://fsn1.your-objectstorage.com）";
"Enter an AWS access key with S3 permissions and the region your buckets live in. You can create a key under IAM → Users → Security credentials → Access keys." = "输入具有 S3 权限的 AWS 访问密钥以及你的存储桶所在的区域。你可以在 IAM → Users → Security credentials → Access keys 下创建密钥。";
"Enter your NAS hostname (or QuickConnect URL) and DSM credentials. The default port is 5001 for HTTPS." = "输入你的 NAS 主机名（或 QuickConnect URL）和 DSM 凭据。HTTPS 的默认端口为 5001。";
"Enter your SFTP server details. You can authenticate with either a password or a private SSH key, and pin the panel to a specific remote folder on first open." = "输入你的 SFTP 服务器详情。你可以使用密码或私有 SSH 密钥进行认证，并在首次打开时将面板固定到特定的远程文件夹。";
"Enter your WebDAV server URL, username, and password." = "输入你的 WebDAV 服务器 URL、用户名和密码。";
"Enter your WordPress site URL and an Application Password. Create one in WordPress under Users → Profile → Application Passwords." = "输入你的 WordPress 站点 URL 和应用专用密码。在 WordPress 的 用户 → 个人资料 → 应用专用密码 中创建一个。";
"FileFluss reads the key file once and stores its contents in the macOS Keychain — moving or deleting the original file later won't affect this account." = "FileFluss 只读取一次密钥文件并将其内容存储在 macOS 钥匙串中——之后移动或删除原始文件不会影响此账户。";
"FileFluss uses your Mac's existing iCloud sign-in — no password needed here. iCloud Drive must be turned on in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud → iCloud Drive." = "FileFluss 使用你 Mac 上现有的 iCloud 登录——此处无需密码。必须在 系统设置 → Apple 账户 → iCloud → iCloud 云盘 中开启 iCloud 云盘。";
"Filen is end-to-end encrypted, so there's no browser OAuth — the password is used locally to derive your master key, then discarded. Only v2 accounts are supported in this release; new Filen accounts default to v2." = "Filen 是端到端加密的，因此没有浏览器 OAuth——密码在本地用于派生你的主密钥，然后被丢弃。此版本仅支持 v2 账户；新的 Filen 账户默认为 v2。";
"Files that aren't currently downloaded show a small iCloud badge in the file list. Copying or syncing them triggers a transparent download first." = "当前未下载的文件会在文件列表中显示一个小的 iCloud 标记。复制或同步它们时会先透明地下载。";
"Find the exact endpoint in your C2 console on the bucket detail page. Pasting the full URL is fine; FileFluss extracts the hostname and region automatically." = "在你的 C2 控制台的存储桶详情页查找确切的端点。粘贴完整 URL 也可以；FileFluss 会自动提取主机名和区域。";
"GMX Email" = "GMX 电子邮件";
"Generic S3-compatible storage — Hetzner Object Storage, MinIO, Wasabi, Backblaze B2, Cloudflare R2, DigitalOcean Spaces, Linode, and the like. Paste the endpoint URL from your provider's console along with the access key it issued." = "通用 S3 兼容存储——Hetzner Object Storage、MinIO、Wasabi、Backblaze B2、Cloudflare R2、DigitalOcean Spaces、Linode 等。粘贴你服务商控制台中的端点 URL 以及它签发的访问密钥。";
"Hostname (e.g. server.example.com)" = "主机名（例如 server.example.com）";
"How to get your token:" = "如何获取你的令牌：";
"Initial path (optional)" = "初始路径（可选）";
"Internxt is end-to-end encrypted — there's no browser OAuth. Your password is used locally to unlock your account mnemonic and derive per-file keys, then discarded." = "Internxt 是端到端加密的——没有浏览器 OAuth。你的密码在本地用于解锁你的账户助记词并派生每个文件的密钥，然后被丢弃。";
"Key file is not a UTF-8 text PEM." = "密钥文件不是 UTF-8 文本 PEM。";
"Leave blank to see all buckets. Otherwise the panel opens directly at this bucket or sub-folder." = "留空以查看所有存储桶。否则面板会直接在此存储桶或子文件夹中打开。";
"Looking up your drives…" = "正在查找你的驱动器…";
"Most home Synology NAS units use a self-signed certificate. Turn this off only if you've installed a real CA-signed cert (e.g. Let's Encrypt)." = "大多数家用 Synology NAS 使用自签名证书。仅当你安装了真正的 CA 签名证书（例如 Let’s Encrypt）时才关闭此项。";
"OTP Code (only if 2-factor auth is on)" = "OTP 验证码（仅当启用双重认证时）";
"Open Infomaniak token page" = "打开 Infomaniak 令牌页面";
"Generate a Personal Login Token in your Jottacloud account, then paste it below." = "在您的 Jottacloud 帐户中生成个人登录令牌，然后将其粘贴到下方。";
"This full-access Google Drive option has reached its user limit. New users should use “Google Drive (Selected Folders)” instead." = "此完全访问的 Google Drive 选项已达到用户上限。新用户应改用“Google Drive（所选文件夹）”。";
"For new Google Drive accounts — no user limit" = "适用于新的 Google Drive 帐户 — 无用户上限";
"Sign in with Google and select the folders FileFluss may use. You can add and manage files in those folders. Files already in them aren't listed — this access mode only exposes what FileFluss adds or you pick." = "使用 Google 登录并选择允许 FileFluss 使用的文件夹。您可以在这些文件夹中添加和管理文件。其中已有的文件不会被列出 — 此访问模式仅显示 FileFluss 添加或您选择的内容。";
"To change which folders FileFluss can access, remove this account and add it again, then pick the folders you want." = "要更改 FileFluss 可访问的文件夹，请移除此帐户并重新添加，然后选择您想要的文件夹。";
"Choose the folders FileFluss may access" = "选择允许 FileFluss 访问的文件夹";
"Open Jottacloud token page" = "打开 Jottacloud 令牌页面";
"Personal Login Token" = "个人登录令牌";
"Jottacloud has no public API, so FileFluss uses the same interface as the official command-line tool. The token is exchanged for a login that's stored in your keychain." = "Jottacloud 没有公开 API，因此 FileFluss 使用与官方命令行工具相同的接口。令牌将被兑换为登录凭据并存储在您的钥匙串中。";
"To reconnect Jottacloud with a new Personal Login Token, remove this account and add it again." = "要使用新的个人登录令牌重新连接 Jottacloud，请移除此帐户并重新添加。";
"Open my.pcloud.com" = "打开 my.pcloud.com";
"Open the TeraBox app and scan this QR code to authorize." = "打开 TeraBox 应用并扫描此二维码以授权。";
"Or enter your username and an app-specific password manually. Create one at Settings → Security → Devices & sessions." = "或手动输入你的用户名和应用专用密码。在 设置 → 安全 → 设备与会话 中创建一个。";
"Or paste a pCloud access token" = "或粘贴 pCloud 访问令牌";
"Or type a custom region code" = "或输入自定义区域代码";
"Passphrase (leave empty if key has none)" = "口令（如果密钥没有则留空）";
"Password" = "密码";
"Path (optional, e.g. my-bucket or my-bucket/my-folder)" = "路径（可选，例如 my-bucket 或 my-bucket/my-folder）";
"Plain FTP sends credentials and data unencrypted. Enable FTPS when the server supports it." = "普通 FTP 以未加密方式发送凭据和数据。当服务器支持时请启用 FTPS。";
"Port" = "端口";
"Region" = "区域";
"Region (leave empty to auto-detect, e.g. fsn1, us-east-1, auto)" = "区域（留空以自动检测，例如 fsn1、us-east-1、auto）";
"Region tips: Hetzner uses the location code (fsn1, nbg1, hel1). Cloudflare R2 expects \"auto\". MinIO and most Backblaze B2 setups want \"us-east-1\"." = "区域提示：Hetzner 使用位置代码（fsn1、nbg1、hel1）。Cloudflare R2 需要“auto”。MinIO 和大多数 Backblaze B2 设置需要“us-east-1”。";
"Remote Path (e.g. /home/me or leave as /)" = "远程路径（例如 /home/me 或保留为 /）";
"SSH Key" = "SSH 密钥";
"Seafile doesn't support browser OAuth — the password is exchanged once for a long-lived API token, then discarded. Self-hosted servers work too." = "Seafile 不支持浏览器 OAuth——密码会被一次性换成一个长期有效的 API 令牌，然后被丢弃。自托管服务器同样可用。";
"Secret Access Key" = "Secret Access Key";
"Select a cloud provider to connect:" = "选择要连接的云服务商：";
"Server (e.g. ftp.example.com)" = "服务器（例如 ftp.example.com）";
"Server URL (e.g. https://cloud.example.com)" = "服务器 URL（例如 https://cloud.example.com）";
"Server URL (e.g. https://dav.example.com/files)" = "服务器 URL（例如 https://dav.example.com/files）";
"Server URL (e.g. https://my-nas.local:5001)" = "服务器 URL（例如 https://my-nas.local:5001）";
"Server URL (e.g. https://seafile.example.com)" = "服务器 URL（例如 https://seafile.example.com）";
"Sign in to %@" = "登录到 %@";
"Sign in with your GMX email and password. GMX Cloud is accessed over WebDAV; this may not work with GMX accounts that have two-factor authentication enabled." = "使用你的 GMX 电子邮件和密码登录。GMX Cloud 通过 WebDAV 访问；对于启用了双重认证的 GMX 账户可能无法使用。";
"Sign in with your Mega email and password." = "使用你的 Mega 电子邮件和密码登录。";
"Sign-in method" = "登录方式";
"Site URL (e.g. https://example.com)" = "站点 URL（例如 https://example.com）";
"Solving security challenge — may take a moment…" = "正在解决安全验证——可能需要片刻…";
"Synology C2 Object Storage is S3-compatible. Generate an access key in the C2 console (Storage Account → Access Keys), then paste it below along with the endpoint URL the console shows for your storage." = "Synology C2 对象存储是 S3 兼容的。在 C2 控制台（存储账户 → 访问密钥）中生成访问密钥，然后将其与控制台为你的存储显示的端点 URL 一起粘贴到下方。";
"TeraBox uses device-code sign-in: tap Connect to get a QR code, then scan it with the TeraBox app to authorize. Access is limited to this app's folder on your TeraBox drive." = "TeraBox 使用设备码登录：点按“连接”获取二维码，然后用 TeraBox 应用扫描以授权。访问仅限于此应用在你 TeraBox 云盘上的文件夹。";
"That doesn't look like a PEM private key. Expected file to start with -----BEGIN." = "这看起来不像 PEM 私钥。文件应以 -----BEGIN 开头。";
"Tip: paste the exact region code (e.g. eu-central-1) from the AWS console URL if you don't see your region listed." = "提示：如果未列出你的区域，请从 AWS 控制台 URL 中粘贴确切的区域代码（例如 eu-central-1）。";
"To use more than one drive, add the kDrive account again with the same token and pick a different drive." = "要使用多个驱动器，请用相同的令牌再次添加 kDrive 账户并选择不同的驱动器。";
"Two-factor code (only if enabled)" = "双重认证验证码（仅当启用时）";
"Use FTPS (TLS)" = "使用 FTPS (TLS)";
"Username" = "用户名";
"Waiting for sign-in in browser…" = "正在等待浏览器中的登录…";
"pCloud no longer issues auth tokens via password login for third-party apps. You can still try email + password below, but most accounts will need to paste an access token." = "pCloud 不再通过密码登录为第三方应用签发认证令牌。你仍可在下方尝试电子邮件 + 密码，但大多数账户需要粘贴访问令牌。";

/* Edit Cloud Account */
"Choose Private Key…" = "选择私钥…";
"Click Re-authorize to open your server's login page in the browser. A new app password is issued and replaces the stored one." = "点按“重新授权”以在浏览器中打开你服务器的登录页面。系统会签发一个新的应用专用密码并替换已存储的密码。";
"Click Re-authorize to sign in again. Your browser will open and the existing token is replaced once you complete the flow." = "点按“重新授权”以重新登录。你的浏览器将打开，完成流程后现有令牌会被替换。";
"Credentials (password or key) are not prefilled and must be re-entered." = "凭据（密码或密钥）不会预填，必须重新输入。";
"Display name (optional)" = "显示名称（可选）";
"Edit %@" = "编辑 %@";
"Endpoint URL" = "端点 URL";
"Hostname" = "主机名";
"Initial path" = "初始路径";
"Or sign in with email and password (pCloud may refuse to issue a new token to third-party apps — paste a pcauth cookie above if that happens)." = "或使用电子邮件和密码登录（pCloud 可能拒绝向第三方应用签发新令牌——如果发生这种情况，请在上方粘贴 pcauth Cookie）。";
"Password is not stored locally and is re-entered each time you edit." = "密码不会保存在本地，每次编辑时都需重新输入。";
"Paste a new Infomaniak API token. The existing workspace selection is preserved." = "粘贴一个新的 Infomaniak API 令牌。现有的工作区选择将保留。";
"Path (optional)" = "路径（可选）";
"Re-authorize" = "重新授权";
"Remote Path" = "远程路径";
"Replace Private Key…" = "替换私钥…";
"Save" = "保存";
"Server" = "服务器";
"Server URL" = "服务器 URL";
"Site URL" = "站点 URL";
"TeraBox signs in with a QR code scanned in the TeraBox app — there's nothing to edit here. To reconnect, remove this account and add it again." = "TeraBox 通过在 TeraBox 应用中扫描二维码登录——此处无可编辑内容。若要重新连接，请移除此账户并重新添加。";
"That doesn't look like a PEM private key." = "这看起来不像 PEM 私钥。";
"iCloud uses your Mac's system sign-in — there's nothing to edit here. Manage iCloud Drive in System Settings → Apple Account → iCloud." = "iCloud 使用你 Mac 的系统登录——此处无可编辑内容。请在 系统设置 → Apple 账户 → iCloud 中管理 iCloud 云盘。";

